# PlayerProperty.java:140-172: Moonshae Pixie's
# `X:PlayerCountOpponents$HasPropertywasDealtCombatDamageThisTurn` counts the
# opponents dealt combat damage this turn. An unblocked Grizzly Bears deals the
# ai 2 combat damage, so the Pixie cast in the second main phase draws one card.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance 2
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
castspell human 6
resolvestack
